# Dynamic Blur Tabs — a custom bottom tab bar (expo-blur + gradient) over a
# 100-tile gradient grid: at scroll offset 0 the bar is full-width and docked,
# once the list scrolls it springs into a floating rounded pill (left/right/
# height/radius/border interpolated); 4 other tabs are empty screens.
# What this test covers: scrolling down (dock -> pill), switching to every tab
# while scrolled and back home, rapid tab switching, a fling deep into the list,
# scrolling back to the top via the status-bar tap (pill -> dock), and a tab
# switch while the spring is mid-flight. Tab x positions are chosen to hit the
# same tab in both bar layouts.
# NOTE: IsTabBarActive is a module-level makeMutable, so the bar state survives
# closing the demo (reopen after closing while scrolled -> pill at offset 0);
# this script ends at the top so reruns start docked. See report.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/dynamic-blur-tabs"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait 1500
gesture pan 200 600 0 -300 400
wait 1200
press 140 792
wait 800
press 200 792
wait 800
press 260 792
wait 800
press 320 792
wait 800
press 80 792
wait 1000
# Rapid switching.
press 140 792
press 80 792
press 320 792
press 80 792
wait 1000
# Fling deep into the list, then jump back to the top (status bar tap).
gesture pan 200 750 0 -600 150
wait 300
gesture pan 200 750 0 -600 150
wait 1500
press 201 12
wait 300
# Switch tab while the bar springs back to the docked layout.
press 140 792
wait 800
press 80 792
wait 1500
press 201 12
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
